pressure, and it's

222
00:12:15,870 --> 00:12:18,750
something that we could
potentially find and fix.

223
00:12:18,890 --> 00:12:21,810
So there are certain patients
we're going to consider

224
00:12:21,810 --> 00:12:25,070
this more so in. So if
there's a patient that has

225
00:12:25,070 --> 00:12:28,430
hypertension but is unresponsive
to their medications,

