a new onset hypertension,

228
00:12:35,630 --> 00:12:39,430
and any acute worsening
of patients who

229
00:12:39,430 --> 00:12:41,710
previously had well
-controlled blood pressure.

230
00:12:44,590 --> 00:12:47,890
so then for the
causes a lot of these

231
00:12:47,890 --> 00:12:50,030
pathologies you guys
are going to learn

232
00:12:50,290 --> 00:12:54,190
more so next semester
but they're here just so

233
00:12:54,190 --> 00:12:56,010
that you know when you
look back you're aware

234
00:12:56,010 --> 00:12:59,950
of the different causes
of this so the first

235
00:12:59,950 --> 00:13:02,140
will be cushing syndrome
hyperparathyroidism

236
00:13:04,110 --> 00:13:06,530
hypothyroidism and
hyperthyroidism so

237
00:13:06,530 --> 00:13:08,950
for those thyroid
